WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
When designing your Shiny app, don't show everything at once.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.600
When you try to cram everything into one screen,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.240
it gets overwhelming fast.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.820
Instead, clean up your app with popovers and tooltips.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.120
Use UITooltip for quick info that appears on hover

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.180
and UIPopover for fully working inputs that pop up on click

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.719
to give your users a nice, clean experience.

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:22.080
Try it in your next app

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.459
or prompt your AI agent to build it for you.

00:00:24.459 --> 00:00:25.820
Let us know how it goes.

